WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.595
Night observation can feel more intrusive because people may reasonably expect greater privacy after dark and may not recognize the aircraft or mission.

00:00:11.595 --> 00:00:17.984
A lawful flight can still cause unnecessary concern or collect sensitive activity.

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:23.427
Limit collection to the authorized purpose, area, time, and detail.

00:00:23.427 --> 00:00:30.762
Aim sensors away from unrelated homes, windows, yards, people, and sensitive facilities where practical.

00:00:30.762 --> 00:00:36.678
Do not use darkness to conceal observation or avoid accountable notice.

00:00:36.678 --> 00:00:45.434
Protect stored imagery and metadata because they may reveal locations, routines, access points, identities, or operational activity.

00:00:45.434 --> 00:00:52.296
Use approved access controls, encrypted storage and transfer where appropriate, and restricted exports.

00:00:52.296 --> 00:00:58.212
Retention should match the mission, policy, legal requirements, and evidentiary need.

00:00:58.212 --> 00:01:02.235
Delete unnecessary incidental material through approved procedures.

00:01:02.235 --> 00:01:07.677
Avoid indefinite storage simply because data is inexpensive to keep.

00:01:07.677 --> 00:01:14.539
Document purpose, authority, crew, time, area, collection settings, access, distribution, and significant decisions.

00:01:14.539 --> 00:01:22.348
Reports should distinguish direct observations from interpretations and avoid exposing sensitive location details without need.

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:26.371
Low-light imagery can also increase misidentification risk.

00:01:26.371 --> 00:01:34.180
Do not label a person, vehicle, activity, or intent from weak silhouettes or noisy video.

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:39.623
Report the visible evidence, limitations, and need for independent confirmation.

00:01:39.623 --> 00:01:49.325
Do not use night operations for stalking, harassment, unlawful surveillance, targeting private individuals, flight-restriction bypass, or evasion of oversight.

00:01:49.325 --> 00:01:54.767
Responsible practice combines safety, privacy, proportionality, and explainable human accountability.
